      "zh": {
        "title": "國防部通報臺灣周邊偵獲共機2架次、共艦6艘",
        "summary": "國防部11月26日公佈，當日上午6時前的24小時內，偵獲共機2架次及共艦6艘。",
        "body": [
          "國防部11月26日公佈臺灣周邊海空域動態。自25日上午6時至26日上午6時，國軍共偵獲解放軍軍機2架次及軍艦6艘。",
          "國防部表示，國軍持續監控周邊海空域動態，並以任務機艦及岸置飛彈系統應處。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "Taiwan reports two PLA aircraft sorties and six naval vessels in daily bulletin",
        "summary": "Taiwan’s defence ministry reported two PLA aircraft sorties and six PLA Navy vessels in the 24 hours ending at 6 a.m. on November 26.",
        "body": [
          "Taiwan’s Ministry of National Defense released its daily report on activity around the island on November 26. It recorded two PLA aircraft sorties and six PLA Navy vessels between 6 a.m. on November 25 and 6 a.m. on November 26.",
          "The ministry said it monitored the activity and responded with aircraft, naval vessels and shore-based missile systems."
        ]
      },
